  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS IS A SPECIAL DRAINAGE, POTABLE WATER, SEWAGE AND TRANSPORT PROJECT WHICH WILL TRANSFORM A THIRD OF THE CITY OF BELEN, INTO A DRY AREA WITH TRANSPORT AND DRAINAGE INFRASTRUCTURE AS WELL AS ACCESS TO POTABLE WATER AND SEWAGE SERVICES.</narrative>
